xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"ON (표면에 접촉, 선/도로 위)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"On"}],"은 어떤 표면 위에 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"접촉"}],"하고 있음을 의미합니다. 또한, 도로, 강, 지도상의 선처럼 '선'의 개념 위에도 사용됩니다."]}],"\n",["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"mt-6 border-l-4 border-yes-blue pl-6 italic text-gray-700 bg-gray-50 py-4 pr-4 rounded-r-[10px]","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["The picture is hanging ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"on"}]," the wall. (수직 표면 접촉)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["I saw a famous actor ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"on"}]," the street. (도로 위)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["Is this flight ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"on"}]," time? (정시에 운행되는지 여부, 추상적 표면)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"AT (특정 지점, 활동 장소)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"At"}],"은 넓은 장소 내의 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"특정 지점(Point)"}],"을 나타내거나, 그 장소에서 이루어지는 ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"활동"}],"을 강조할 때 사용됩니다."]}],"\n",["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"mt-6 border-l-4 border-yes-blue pl-6 italic text-gray-700 bg-gray-50 py-4 pr-4 rounded-r-[10px]","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["She is waiting for me ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"at"}]," the entrance. (특정 지점)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["We had dinner ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"at"}]," a new restaurant. (활동 장소)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["The meeting will be held ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"at"}]," the library. (건물 이름이 아닌 '장소'의 개념)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 학습 팁 (청각/반복 학습자):"}]," YES 수업에서 장소에 대한 이야기를 할 때, 선생님께 내가 자주 가는 장소 5군데(예: 카페, 학교, 공원 등)를 목록으로 만들고, 각 장소에 ",["$","em","em-0",{"children":"at"}],"이나 ",["$","em","em-1",{"children":"in"}]," 중 무엇이 적절한지 교정 받아 보세요. 반복적인 듣기와 말하기를 통해 자연스럽게 습득됩니다."]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-2",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"이동 전치사 마스터하기: 방향과 경로의 차이"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-12-03-prepositions-time-place-movement-1-h2-3.jpg","alt":"이동 전치사 마스터하기: 방향과 경로의 차이","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"이동 전치사 마스터하기: 방향과 경로의 차이"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["이동 전치사는 단순히 '어디에 있다'를 넘어 ",["$","s